{"4577310": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "ALTAR CORP", "steam_appid": 4577310, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4577310/extras/d63d2066dfdfc84cc84418a07a3ffad8.poster.avif?t=1783365942\" width=560 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4577310/extras/d63d2066dfdfc84cc84418a07a3ffad8.webm?t=1783365942\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4577310/extras/d63d2066dfdfc84cc84418a07a3ffad8.mp4?t=1783365942\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ALTAR CORP </strong>is a solo rhythmic FPS in which you play as <strong>Leyla</strong>, a young woman searching for her missing brother <strong>Orven</strong> in the heart of <strong>Yerneth</strong>: an abandoned city once dedicated to knowledge now overrun by <strong>Lowkihs</strong>, blind creatures with hyper-developed senses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sent under the guise of an extermination mission, <strong>Leyla</strong> gradually uncovers that the truth behind <strong>Yerneth</strong> and <strong>ALTAR CORP</strong>, the scientific corporation that once controlled it, is far more complex than she was told.<br><br><strong>SHOOT IN SYNC</strong><br><strong></strong><br>Lowkihs are blind, but they're not forgiving. While exploring the Altar Corp tower, fire in rhythm with the room's current track with the help of the animated crosshair to boost your score and earn better rewards. <br><br><strong>EXPLORE THE CITY</strong><br><strong></strong><br>Yerneth has plenty to discover. Talk to locals, loot what you find, set up your own space with furniture, and play your favorite tracks as you wander through the city.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4577310/extras/d63d2066dfdfc84cc84418a07a3ffad8.poster.avif?t=1783365942\" width=560 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4577310/extras/d63d2066dfdfc84cc84418a07a3ffad8.webm?t=1783365942\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4577310/extras/d63d2066dfdfc84cc84418a07a3ffad8.mp4?t=1783365942\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ALTAR CORP </strong>is a solo rhythmic FPS in which you play as <strong>Leyla</strong>, a young woman searching for her missing brother <strong>Orven</strong> in the heart of <strong>Yerneth</strong>: an abandoned city once dedicated to knowledge now overrun by <strong>Lowkihs</strong>, blind creatures with hyper-developed senses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sent under the guise of an extermination mission, <strong>Leyla</strong> gradually uncovers that the truth behind <strong>Yerneth</strong> and <strong>ALTAR CORP</strong>, the scientific corporation that once controlled it, is far more complex than she was told.<br><br><strong>SHOOT IN SYNC</strong><br><strong></strong><br>Lowkihs are blind, but they're not forgiving. While exploring the Altar Corp tower, fire in rhythm with the room's current track with the help of the animated crosshair to boost your score and earn better rewards. <br><br><strong>EXPLORE THE CITY</strong><br><strong></strong><br>Yerneth has plenty to discover. Talk to locals, loot what you find, set up your own space with furniture, and play your favorite tracks as you wander through the city.</p>", "short_description": "A solo rhythmic FPS in t